      <div class="entry-content" data-io-article-url="https://www.indyturk.com/node/559216/haber/6-lider-chp-genel-merkezinde-bulu%C5%9Ftu-g%C3%B6sterece%C4%9Fimiz-ortak-aday-t%C3%BCrkiye%E2%80%99nin-13">
